+            /*
+             * AND DUMP THE TREES FROM HERE, NOT FROM A FLUSH.
+             *
+             * CIDER_TRACE_TREE used to hang off -flushWindow, so a window that has settled and
+             * stopped drawing could never be dumped, and a pane swapped in by a click is exactly
